        <mj-text mj-class="kicker" padding="0 0 4px">Chris Spears</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 6px"><a href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/chris-spears-photo-gallery-florida-ole-miss?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_09_28&utm_content=best_shots_vol_1" style="color:#081B35;text-decoration:none;"><div style="font:700 21px/1.15 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;color:#081B35;">Chris Spears' Best Shots: Florida 52, Ole Miss 28</div></a></mj-text>
        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">Chris Spears had the sideline for all of it. His best photos from The Swamp as Florida ran over No. 4 Ole Miss, 52-28.</mj-text>
