        <mj-text font-size="14px" color="#4B5666" padding="0 0 10px">No. 8 Florida's reward for routing Ole Miss is a trip to No. 25 Missouri, which let a fourth-quarter lead get away at Mississippi State.</mj-text>
        <mj-button href="https://www.gatorbaitmedia.com/post/first-look-missouri-florida-gators-show-me-state-of-mind?utm_source=gatorbait_magazine_newsletter&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=roundup_2026_09_28&utm_content=missouri_first_look" align="left" padding="0">READ →</mj-button>
